            <fr:title text="(M8): the per-cell modality reduction at n = 8">(M8): the per-cell modality reduction at n = 8</fr:title>
            <fr:taxon>theorem</fr:taxon>
            <fr:meta name="area">height</fr:meta>
            <fr:meta name="status">conditional</fr:meta>
            <fr:meta name="provenance">journal thm:m8 (sixteenth pass); pseudo_levi_gap.sage all-pass; commit afdac1f.</fr:meta>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>(M8). Every cell of the <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[n = 8]]></fr:tex> address decomposition has
per-cell modality small enough that no cell can carry a violation of
<fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0010/" title="(*): the characteristic-p subvariety inference" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0010/" display-uri="ffi-0010" type="local">(*)</fr:link>.</html:p>
            <html:p><html:strong>Mechanism.</html:strong> Two ingredients. <html:strong>Pseudo-Levi collapse</html:strong>: the per-cell
modality satisfies <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[M(8) = 1]]></fr:tex>, so each cell is a one-modulus problem of
the kind <fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0020/" title="Height at n ≤ 7" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0020/" display-uri="ffi-0020" type="local">height at <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[n \le  7]]></fr:tex></fr:link> already handles.
<html:strong>Torus-defect dichotomy</html:strong>: a cell either has torus defect placing
it below the threshold, or lies in the gap-7 regime where Lang--Weil
against <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[4v^9]]></fr:tex> excludes it. The two cases are exhaustive.</html:p>
            <html:p><html:strong>Status.</html:strong> Proven by theory, conditional only on the published GMR2014 data
for <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[A_7]]></fr:tex> (degree 9, leading coefficient 4). The genericity step in
pseudo_levi_gap.sage needs <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[|F| \gtrsim  10^4]]></fr:tex> to be visible
numerically; the argument itself is characteristic-free.</html:p>
            <html:p><html:em>Uses:</html:em> <fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0010/" title="(*): the characteristic-p subvariety inference" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0010/" display-uri="ffi-0010" type="local">(*): the characteristic-p subvariety inference</fr:link>, <fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0027/" title="Borel modality" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0027/" display-uri="ffi-0027" type="local">Borel modality</fr:link>, <fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0028/" title="U-modality" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0028/" display-uri="ffi-0028" type="local">U-modality</fr:link>.</html:p>
          </fr:mainmatter>
        </fr:tree>
        <fr:tree show-metadata="true" expanded="false" toc="false" numbered="false">
          <fr:frontmatter>
            <fr:authors />
            <fr:uri>https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0023/</fr:uri>
            <fr:display-uri>ffi-0023</fr:display-uri>
