            <fr:title text="(S): the n = 9 reduction">(S): the n = 9 reduction</fr:title>
            <fr:taxon>theorem</fr:taxon>
            <fr:meta name="area">height</fr:meta>
            <fr:meta name="status">proven</fr:meta>
            <fr:meta name="provenance">journal subsec:seventeenth and subsec:eighteenth; census53_cells.log (canonical, 53 addresses degree 10 lc 1 per characteristic), sweep16_rank.log (exact-<fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathbb {Q}]]></fr:tex> ranks, 16 nonlinear loci); commit e8c7430.</fr:meta>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>(S). At <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[n = 9]]></fr:tex> the violation locus of <fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0010/" title="(*): the characteristic-p subvariety inference" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0010/" display-uri="ffi-0010" type="local">(*)</fr:link> is
covered by finitely many identified loci, all of which are cold.</html:p>
            <html:p><html:strong>Mechanism.</html:strong> Three layers, all machine-checked. <html:strong>Sweep census by
involutions</html:strong>: 2620 classes, of which the three <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[f = 3]]></fr:tex> classes are
exactly the three maximizer tableaux (verified) and 51 carry <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[f = 2]]></fr:tex>.
<html:strong>Linear layer</html:strong>: 4862 ideals across 5 characteristics, all cold,
including exact <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathbb {Q}]]></fr:tex>; a covering theorem makes the finite check
exhaustive. <html:strong>Cascade</html:strong>: 53 safe ten-moduli loci, with the boundary
probe at layer 1 also cold.</html:p>
            <html:p>The captured <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[f = 2]]></fr:tex> case is killed characteristic-free by the
cross-term and tangent lemmas, and <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\operatorname {mod}(B : \mathfrak {n}_{9}) = 3]]></fr:tex> characteristic-free,
so no <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[f = 3]]></fr:tex> violation is available either. The residual ledger is
<fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[72 = 53 + \sum  c'_i + m_{\text {unknown}}]]></fr:tex>, closed by
<fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0024/" title="(S+): the ledger conjecture" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0024/" display-uri="ffi-0024" type="local">(S+)</fr:link>.</html:p>
            <html:p><html:em>Uses:</html:em> <fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0010/" title="(*): the characteristic-p subvariety inference" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0010/" display-uri="ffi-0010" type="local">(*): the characteristic-p subvariety inference</fr:link>, <fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0027/" title="Borel modality" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0027/" display-uri="ffi-0027" type="local">Borel modality</fr:link>.</html:p>
          </fr:mainmatter>
        </fr:tree>
        <fr:tree show-metadata="true" expanded="false" toc="false" numbered="false">
          <fr:frontmatter>
            <fr:authors />
            <fr:uri>https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0020/</fr:uri>
            <fr:display-uri>ffi-0020</fr:display-uri>
